imud (1.5.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix two C11 data races: the hot-reload/live
    navigation values are now published under a lock and read via snapshot
    (fusion/reader threads) or atomics (output rates); the stream shutdown
    packet is sent by the stream thread itself (single-owner client list).
  * Validate gpsd/Signal K numeric input: reject NaN/Inf, truncated numbers,
    and out-of-range lat/lon before they reach the filter.
  * Log pthread failures via the returned error code, not errno.
  * SIGHUP now applies heave_tau_s/wave_tau_s/mag_yaw_only (previously
    dropped). New ThreadSanitizer concurrency test in CI.

